flowchart TD
Start["**MOO Optimization Start**<br/>Initiate NSGA2 optimization run"]
NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Evolves populations<br/>Uses Problem evaluation to score individuals"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Decision vars 6 buffer capacities {1-10}<br/>Enforces sum of capacities constraint"]
InputVars["**Input Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities for DelayBuffers<br/>{1-10} discrete"]
ConstraintNode["**Capacity Constraint**<br/>Sum of all buffer capacities must be <= 40"]
MultiprocPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Parallel evaluation across cores<br/>Spawns worker processes"]
EvaluateInd["**evaluate single individual**<br/>Runs n replications per candidate<br/>Returns objectives [-throughput, energy per part]"]
RunSimWithCaps["**run simulation with caps**<br/>Constructs DelayBuffers with given capacities<br/>Executes simulation and returns KPIs"]
RunSim["**run simulation**<br/>Simulates production system behavior<br/>Measures throughput production and per machine energy"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Buffer class with capacity and delay<br/>Tracks ready items and in transit tokens"]
Machine["**Machine**<br/>Processes parts with failures and shift windows<br/>Tracks working and waiting energy"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Maximize throughput<br/>Minimize energy consumption per part"]
ResultAggregator["**Optimization Result**<br/>Pareto front of feasible solutions<br/>Throughput and energy per part"]
CSVExport["**Export History to CSV**<br/>Writes feasible solutions from all generations<br/>Saves KPIs and decision variables to results folder"]

Start --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> InputVars
BufferProblem --> ConstraintNode
BufferProblem --> MultiprocPool
MultiprocPool --> EvaluateInd
EvaluateInd --> RunSimWithCaps
RunSimWithCaps --> DelayBuffer
RunSimWithCaps --> Machine
RunSimWithCaps --> RunSim
RunSim --> DelayBuffer
RunSim --> Machine
RunSim --> EvaluateInd
EvaluateInd --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> Objectives
NSGA2Algorithm --> ResultAggregator
ResultAggregator --> CSVExport